he original on February 24, 2024 . Retrieved May 12, 2024 . ^ Stallman, Richard M. (2002). \"Linux, GNU, and freedom\" . Philosophy of the GNU Project . GNU Project. Archived from the original on December 23, 2017 . Retrieved December 10, 2006 . ^ Feller, Joseph (2005). Perspectives on Free and Open Source Software . MIT Press. ISBN 978-0-262-06246-6 . ^ \"Licenses\" . Free Software Foundation. Archived from the original on April 6, 2011 . Retrieved June 24, 2012 .",
